{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>內地歌手李昊在紅館舉行一連兩場《李昊「數到一」香港演唱會2026》，今晚尾場請來影后張栢芝擔任嘉賓，少有在香港公開露面的張栢芝，以一身黑色西裝示人，照樣無死角靚到發光。早前栢芝前老爺謝賢離世，栢芝在社交平台轉黑色頭像低調悼念，今日見她表演時相當投入，盡見專業。栢芝合唱了李昊新專輯中廣東歌《江湖再見》，邊唱邊上演了一幕飲紅酒的戲碼，二人貼身相擁，相當有戲。</p><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624999796477952801326.jpeg/oa9NUEwazprw8vWnWUXn38wy8rqL-iMf5g8lvsAPJb4\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624987896713216563971.jpeg/I1pMwiUgbx3vY8tlpaNQufAqk3AMHKGAqLldLo65XS4\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624991088709632507492.jpeg/cLQAskDaHkP1p15XNeKU7NgwVY2EXXNIKxzWRA0c1kQ\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159625000954105856509378.jpeg/D94A9_tbKuTuzmix069lJJlIcTwkc5NTjQlPMqsJTzI\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><p>唱完後，李昊叫大家給張栢芝最大最大的掌聲，栢芝指能再踏紅館非常感恩，李昊則多次表示栢芝是自己女神，自爆是周星馳fans，表示：「我覺得追星最高境界，是追到他曾經的女主角！」接著他還在台上向栢芝高呼《喜劇之王》經典對白：「我養你呀！」</p><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624997707583488943175.jpeg/_zGQia9HVRrvD-sd3tdHVQTNiTERipx_I9o3vQXaN70\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624994389757952134768.jpeg/GCz_NcsPdJl4DpqqKKZpsE6Vh9z1wWmj7enWPsvp1j4\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624997036494848651208.jpeg/vvu1Js9sOLaYbxUwZxa1kMzWkRqm1w5rohkx84QZMfM\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624994184237056789246.jpeg/U5QmMJP5qOtw8xo9CaIH8pFpRqpZH4K5q1o3JI1aNyQ\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624991088709632086724.jpeg/vwn_ZXYslTAyZRo1nGHvE1WE81h4pqMgEQlNrTcJTa0\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（胡凱欣攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260730/1159624987754106880318096.jpeg/mYPqfGM2uLePFPrxQJLdu8t5AYbud5j2qmeo_IxnqPw\"/><figcaption>（胡凱欣攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T14:59:38.925672+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":365,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}